WEBVTT

00:00:56.186 --> 00:01:00.976
He was full of macho,
a kind of macho one-upmanship.

00:01:01.455 --> 00:01:05.058
He loved intellectual battle.

00:01:05.405 --> 00:01:08.054
He had a gargantuan ego.

00:01:09.157 --> 00:01:12.633
But the man had, somehow,

00:01:12.657 --> 00:01:15.109
a lot of room at the bottom.

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:19.863
And what I mean by that
is a lot of room, in my case --

00:01:19.887 --> 00:01:22.976
I can't speak for anybody else,
but in my case --

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.279
a lot of room for another big ego.

00:01:26.303 --> 00:01:27.693
Well, not as big as his,

00:01:27.717 --> 00:01:29.597
but fairly big.